    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Hahahah-hah... Hah-hahahahah!!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#19$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "I got to see every one of your sorriest, most helpless, most laughable moments."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "You may have destroyed the dreams I spun, but I suppose this makes us even."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "And I have to thank you. You roamed their dreams again and again..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "In the process, proving to me that the dreamlands I wove were perfect, impeccable."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "And now, even that pest ought to admit it. It's me. I'm the most talented of us all in the Castle of Dreams."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "'Pest'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Didn't you meet her in your dream?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "The snooty girl? Flowery high-nobility frock? All the outdated pleasantries?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Just being around her puts me ill at ease."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Iris is this place's master. You are nothing but a fraud!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "She said it! No matter how sweet the dream, one has to wake up in the end\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Nngh\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko feels her vocal cords freeze in place. She cannot make even the slightest peep."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "You know what? I finally understand why you get on my nerves so much."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "You're just like her. You never listen to what others think. You just sit there spouting big, empty words forever."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "You say they entrusted their lives to you, but let's be fair. You just don't want to be abandoned by others. Isn't that right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "I've seen your life. There's not much to it. Just a princess's stubborn struggle after her fall from grace."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Each and every action of yours was done to deceive and persuade yourself, and to present yourself as never having fallen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "You're self-important, conceited, and an utter lost cause."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#16$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "What exactly does your band entail? Hmph. Just a bunch of girls using a so-called contract to bind one another for fun."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "And now that they've all found happiness, of course they're abandoning you. Poor Sakiko Togawa. All alone once more."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "If you really believe what Iris said, then fine, I'll prepare another round of the sweetest dreams for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "It'll be perfect, impeccable. Realize it's a farce all you want, you still won't want to wake up."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Like your bandmates, you'll wallow in your dreams, unable to ever pluck yourself out."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "Nngh\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Something to say? Alright, you get one last time. Speak your mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The impish girl draws a pattern in the air, and there is a sensation of chains falling away."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa",
        "text": "I\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, the chains are pulled tight once again."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#19$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Hahahah-hah-hah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "I knew it. You are <i>much</i> cuter when you're not talking!"
    },
    {
        "text": "As Sakiko struggles, Morpheus paces closer, step by step. Out reaches her right hand, and she places it on Sakiko's cheek."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "O ye, Princess of Hypocrisy. While you were on your dream tour, I've come to completely understand you as a person."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "What you thirst for the most, what you need the most, and what you fear the most."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "But don't worry. This dream? Will be absolutely perfect. You'll be more awake than ever. Not that you'll ever want to wake up."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Now sleep, my noble, selfish, conceited little doll girl."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus",
        "text": "Sweet dreams."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
